  "title": "PDML: speed up writing",
  "description": "Speed this up by:\n- avoiding slow formatting call of %02x for each hex byte\n- build strings up where possible and flush with fewer calls to fputs()\n\nSomeone mentioned this in the sharkfest chat yesterday.\nAlso, Ostinato relies upon this when importing from pcap.\n\nFor a test capture, reduced time from 18 to 11 seconds.",
